    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about expectations anymore. i've surpassed all of them. i have the money, the title, the influence... and it feels like nothing. it's like I'm running on a treadmill that won't stop, and I'm just waiting for the machine to break so I can finally stop running. i just want the noise to stop. i just want some actual, permanent quiet.",
