      "content": "exactly. a pause. but every time i try to take a break, the world just pulls me back in. the emails, the calls, the obligations... it's relentless. i feel like i'm drowning in all this \"success.\" is there even a way to find that kind of stillness without everything just falling apart? or is once you're in this cycle, the only real way to get that silence is to just... leave it all behind entirely?",
